// M4-B09 Context Part G, scenario 2 (zombie_refuses_a_four_block_drop): a walkable
// floor plane at y=63 across x in {0,1,2}, z in 0..=12, with the floor entirely absent
// (defaulting to air down to the world below -- a 4-block-deep pit) at the (0,*,6) and
// (1,*,6) columns -- the shortest straight line from spawn (0,64,0) to the waypoint
// (0,64,12) crosses the pit directly; the x=2 lane stays intact as the walk-around
// route. The zombie carries no live AI target for this scenario -- find_path is
// invoked directly against the waypoint (Context Part G).
//
